  "remarks": "JSC Commercial Bank Solidarnost is a major regional universal bank \nheadquarted in Samara region of the Russian Federation. The banking sector \nis a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the \nRussianFederation. Therefore, JSC Commercial Bank Solidarnost is involved \nin an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the \nGovernment of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the \nannexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
